@startuml A07-checkout-classify
title A07 — classifyEvent : evenement reel emis -> etape funnel (etat actuel vs cible)

skinparam shadowing false
legend top
  ROUGE = mapping manquant aujourd'hui (AN-04)
  VERT  = cible apres fix
end legend

state "Evenements reels (DB 90j)" as src {
  state "view_cart (0)"          as VC
  state "begin_checkout (97)"    as BC
  state "checkout_intent (0)"    as CI
  state "lead_capture (52)"      as LC
  state "address_completed (15)" as AC
  state "add_shipping_info (4)"  as ASI
  state "add_payment_info (18)"  as API
  state "checkout_submit (0)"    as CS
  state "purchase (13)"          as PU
  state "purchase_server (0)"    as PS
}

state "CHECKOUT_STAGES" as stages {
  state "view_cart"      as Svc
  state "begin_checkout" as Sbc
  state "add_shipping"   as Sas
  state "add_payment"    as Sap
  state "submit"         as Ssub
  state "purchase"       as Spu
}

VC  --> Svc
BC  --> Sbc
ASI --> Sas
API --> Sap
CS  --> Ssub : (event jamais emis)
PU  --> Spu
PS  --> Spu

' Mapping manquant (AN-04)
AC  ..> Sas #red : NON mappe aujourd'hui\n(classifyEvent attend add_shipping_info)
CI  ..> Sbc #green : [SPEC] checkout_intent -> begin_checkout ?
LC  ..> Sbc #green : [SPEC] lead_capture -> begin_checkout ?
PU  ..> Ssub #orange : submit=true pose a l'arrivee du purchase\n=> submit recopie purchase (pas de signal propre)

note bottom of stages
  Etat actuel: add_shipping=4 (ignore 15 address_completed),
  view_cart=0, submit==purchase, abandons base sur begin_checkout+purchase.
  Cible: add_shipping = address_completed OR add_shipping_info (=19),
  submit issu d'un checkout_submit reel.
end note
@enduml
